This project makes use of clip and diffusion to take in dnd items and their descriptions in the hope of being able to generate an image with text built in. The reason for dnd items is because due to their built in text it makes them prime candidates for linking meaningful descriptions to dnd items. This model also makes use of a RAG like model where instead of embeddings from text being used, it makes use of the CLIP output. Output images can be found through dataset\generated_items
